message: "If you use CUE-2350 MIC, please cite it as below."
title: "CUE-2350 MIC"
abstract: >-
  A macOS menu-bar app that turns the EP-2350 FX-MIC into a voice and gesture
  remote for your Mac and your coding agent. Local speech-to-text, optional
  local LLM, nothing stored on the device.
type: software
